      "id": "word-fábrica",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "fábrica",
      "answerEn": "factory",
      "noteEn": "Fábrica is stressed on the first syllable, so the written accent is required. Fabrica without an accent is a verb form meaning ‘he, she, or it manufactures.’",
