      "id": "word-como--comparison",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "como",
      "answerEn": "like; as (making a comparison)",
      "noteEn": "Unaccented como can introduce the person, thing, or situation used for a comparison. It does not ask “how”; the question word cómo has an accent.",
      "example": {
